BLACKSTAR — We Just Needed One Shipping Label

Animation engine and style grammar:
- Lemo-Opuscar, Sci-Fi Sitcom Toon source and vector renderer. Used as the production engine under the repository's licence. No demo characters, story, dialogue, device design, world sequence, shots, music, or ending are reused.

Voice:
- Kokoro TTS / kokoro-onnx, offline voice generation. Voices: af_nicole (Marn), am_eric (Kip). See upstream package/model licences included by the Lemo-Opuscar voice tier.

Speech verification:
- faster-whisper, used locally in GitHub Actions only to verify generated dialogue and produce word timing data.

Fonts:
- Baloo 2 — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- VT323 — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Fetched by styles/scifi-toon/demo/tools/fonts.sh from Google Fonts.

Music and sound:
- Original score and sound effects synthesized in code for this film. No stock music, commercial samples, or generated music model output.

Brand:
- BLACKSTAR v5 assets from this repository, owned/provided by the project owner.
